Wrap Key API
1. Overview
The Wrap Key API is used to encrypt and protect plaintext keys or
keys stored in KMS. It supports both symmetric and asymmetric
encryption algorithms to generate secure key ciphertexts,
facilitating secure storage and transmission.
2. API Definition
2.1 Request Method
/**
* Wrap Key
*
* @param req Wrap key request object
* @return Response containing the wrapped key
* @throws HXCSDKException Exception during the wrapping process
*/
public APIResponse<WrapKeyResponse>
wrapKey(APIRequest<WrapKeyRequest> req) throws HXCSDKException
